 no-underline hover:underline" href="/league/">View all leagues<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="size-4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="px-3 md:px-0"><section class="space-y-6 panel px-4 py-3"><div class="content-prose"><h2>Football live score, schedule and matches</h2><div class="cms-html-content cms-html-prose cms-html-tables"><p>APWin is your free, daily home for <strong>football predictions</strong>, <strong>in-depth match statistics</strong>, and <strong>live stream</strong> guides — covering every fixture played today across more than 400 national and international competitions.</p><p>On any given matchday, APWin tracks between 400 and 600 fixtures across <strong>hundreds of competitions worldwide</strong> — from Europe&#039;s top five leagues to cup rounds, international qualifiers, and women&#039;s football.</p><p>Want to know more about us? Visit<a href='https://www.apwin.com/about/'> APWin’s about us page</a> or get to know<a href='https://www.apwin.com/authors/'> our specialists</a> in the world’s most popular sport.</p><h2 id='in-depth-match-statistics-across-all-competitions'>In-Depth Match Statistics Across All Competitions</h2><p>APWin&#039;s match stats pages go well beyond the scoreline and give you the numbers that actually drive intelligent betting decisions:</p><ul><li><p>Goals scored and conceded by half, across the current season</p></li><li><p>Expected Goals (xG) for both attack and defence</p></li><li><p>Corners, cards, and fouls — total counts and per-match averages</p></li><li><p>Head-to-head records going back multiple seasons</p></li><li><p>Winning and losing streaks, clean sheet runs, and scoring trends</p></li><li><p>Form tables filtered by home, away, and combined performance</p></li></ul><h2 id='where-to-watch-today&#039;s-football-live'>Where to Watch Today&#039;s Football Live</h2><p>Finding out which platform is showing a specific match used to mean checking three or four different websites. On APWin, every match page includes the broadcast details — TV channel, streaming service, or sports betting site — for that fixture, updated daily.</p><p>📺 Check out today’s matches with<a href='https://www.apwin.com/streams/'> live streaming</a> from all around the world.</p><h2 id='predictions-for-today’s-football-matches'>Predictions for today’s football matches</h2><p>Our team produces predictions based on statistics, club news, recent team form, goal averages, and much more. In other words, you get insights from those who really know the game before placing your bet.</p><p>⚽ Check out<a href='https://www.apwin.com/predictions/'> today’s football predictions</a> now.</p></div></div></section></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main><footer class="mt-auto bg-muted-elevated text-card-foreground"><div class="container py-10 md:py-12"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-8"><div><p class="heading-group">Today&#x27;s Main Matches</p><ul class="mt-3 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/match/newcastle-united-coventry-city/ccJQB/">Coventry City vs Newcastle United</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/match/slavia-praha-sabah/fFIIP/">Sabah vs Slavia Praha</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/match/sporting-cp-lens/rHxni/">Lens vs Sporting</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/match/manchester-united-atletico-madrid/btgns/">Atlético Madrid vs Manchester United</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/match/rb-leipzig-ps