dictions\",\"under-2\":{\"5\":\"under-2.5\"},\"over-2\":{\"5\":\"over-2.5\"},\"btts\":\"btts\",\"clean-sheet\":\"clean-sheet\",\"second-half\":\"second-half\",\"first-half\":\"first-half\",\"over-under-goals\":\"over-under-goals\",\"scoring-conceding-first\":\"scoring-conceding-first\",\"streams\":\"streams\",\"standings\":\"standings\",\"cards\":\"cards\",\"corners\":\"corners\",\"goals\":\"goals\",\"tomorrow\":\"tomorrow\",\"yesterday\":\"yesterday\",\"predictions\":\"predictions\",\"trends_url\":\"trends\",\"teams_url\":\"teams\",\"leagues_url\":\"leagues\",\"league_url\":\"league\",\"login_url\":\"login\",\"match_url\":\"match\",\"team_url\":\"team\",\"pricing_url\":\"pricing\",\"terms-conditions_url\":\"terms-conditions\",\"cookies_url\":\"cookies\",\"privacy-policy_url\":\"privacy-policy\",\"contact_url\":\"contact\",\"about_url\":\"about\",\"forgot-password_url\":\"forgot-password\",\"signup_url\":\"signup\",\"bookies\":\"bookies\",\"decreasing-stats\":\"decreasing-stats\",\"billing_url\":\"account/billing\",\"member_bankroll_url\":\"account/bankroll\",\"member_glossary_url\":\"account/glossary\",\"member_preferences_url\":\"account/preferences\",\"member_academy_url\":\"account/academy\",\"dashboard\":\"account/dashboard\",\"premium\":\"account/premium\",\"member_faq_url\":\"account/faq\",\"member_password_url\":\"account/security\",\"member_home_url\":\"account/profile\"},\"alert\":{\"language\":{\"Colombia\":\"Colombia\",\"Mexico\":\"Mexico\",\"Peru\":\"Peru\",\"Chile\":\"Chile\",\"French\":\"French\",\"Portuguese\":\"Portuguese\",\"Spanish\":\"Spanish\",\"English\":\"English\"},\"but you are located in\":\"but you are located in {country_name}\",\"We have noticed that you are seeing the website in\":\"We have noticed that you are seeing the website in\",\"switch_to\":\"Switch to\",\"Yes, Change to\":\"Yes, Change to {language}\",\"No, Stay in\":\"No, Stay in {language}\",\"Would you like to change to\":\"Would you like to change to\"},\"ordinal_words\":{\"1\":\"first\",\"2\":\"second\",\"3\":\"third\",\"4\":\"fourth\",\"5\":\"fifth\",\"6\":\"sixth\",\"7\":\"seventh\",\"8\":\"eighth\",\"9\":\"ninth\",\"10\":\"tenth\",\"11\":\"eleventh\",\"12\":\"twelfth\",\"13\":\"thirteenth\",\"14\":\"fourteenth\",\"15\":\"fifteenth\",\"16\":\"sixteenth\",\"17\":\"seventeenth\",\"18\":\"eighteenth\",\"19\":\"nineteenth\",\"20\":\"twentieth\",\"21\":\"twenty-first\",\"22\":\"twenty-second\",\"23\":\"twenty-third\",\"24\":\"twenty-fourth\",\"25\":\"twenty-fifth\",\"26\":\"twenty-sixth\",\"27\":\"twenty-seventh\",\"28\":\"twenty-eighth\",\"29\":\"twenty-ninth\",\"30\":\"thirtieth\",\"31\":\"thirty-first\",\"32\":\"thirty-second\",\"33\":\"thirty-third\",\"34\":\"thirty-fourth\",\"35\":\"thirty-fifth\",\"36\":\"thirty-sixth\",\"37\":\"thirty-seventh\",\"38\":\"thirty-eighth\",\"39\":\"thirty-ninth\",\"40\":\"fortieth\",\"41\":\"forty-first\",\"42\":\"forty-second\",\"43\":\"forty-third\",\"44\":\"forty-fourth\",\"45\":\"forty-fifth\",\"46\":\"forty-sixth\",\"47\":\"forty-seventh\",\"48\":\"forty-eighth\",\"49\":\"forty-ninth\",\"50\":\"fiftieth\"},\"faq_dynamic\":{\"standings_match_scoring_conceding_5\":\"It should prove useful to study these teams’ tendencies of scoring or conceding first, as well as whether these tendencies change when they play at home or away in {competition_name}.\",\"standings_match_btts_3\":\"Check out the BTTS (both teams to score) stats for the match:\",\"standings_match_scoring_conceding_3\":\"Meanwhile, \u003ca href=\\\"{team_b_url}\\\"\u003e{team_b}\u003c/a\u003e comes into this contest having scored a goal before their opponent in {team_b_scoring_percentage}% of matches in this campaign. And in terms of giving up the first goal, they have done so in {team_b_conceding_percentage}% of matches.\",\"standings_match_scoring_conceding_2\":\"{team_a} has come out and scored the first goal in {team_a_scoring_percentage}% of the matches they have played so far in the \u003ca href=\\\"{competition_url}\\\"\u003e{competition_name}\u003c/a\u003e. And on the other side, they have conceded the first goal in {team_a_conceding_percentage}% of matches.\",\"standings_match_cleansheet_1\":\"The number of clean sheets, or matches a team has without conceding a single goal, in a competition is a strong indicator of how well their defence is playing. The more times a team can completely keep their opponents from scoring, the more likely it is the team’s actual ability rather than just random chance.\",\"standings_match_cleansheet_2\":\"We keep track of all the clean sheet information here, and these are the stats for \u003ca href=\\\"{match_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a} vs {team_b}:\u003c/a\u003e\",\"standings_match_cleansheet_4\":\"In {team_a_mp_home} home matches in the {competition_name}, {team_a} has had {team_a_num_cs_home} matches without conceding a goal. {team_b} has played {team_b_mp_overall} matches and has shut out opponents on {team_b_num_cs_overall} occasions. That means they \u003cstrong\u003ehave held clean sheets in {team_b_percentage_cs_overall}% of their matches.\u003c/strong\u003e\",\"standings_match_scoring_conceding_4\":\"This information helps to provide a deeper insight into the two teams’ play in the competition. A higher rate of scoring the first goal indicates a more aggressive side that imposes its will onto its opponents. Similarly, a high rate of conceding the first goal points to a side whose defence struggles to keep things tight at the back.\",\"standings_match_btts_4\":\"In {team_a_mp_overall} matches played in the {competition_name}, \u003cstrong\u003e{team_a} has scored and conceded goals in {team_a_btts_num_overall} matches.\u003c/strong\u003e In other words, \u003cstrong\u003e{team_a_btts_percentage_overall}% of its matches have seen both teams score.\u003c/strong\u003e Their BTTS percentage is {team_a_btts_percentage_home}% at home, while it is {team_a_btts_percentage_away}% away from home.\",\"standings_match_2nd_half_8\":\"The 2nd half is the most critical part of any match. It’s when the main tactical and personnel adjustments are made and physical and mental fatigue start to set in.\",\"standings_match_2nd_half_7\":\"On the other side, {team_b} has played in {team_b_mp_overall} matches, and their record during the final 45 minutes is: {team_b_win_overall} wins, {team_b_draw_overall} draws, and {team_b_lose_overall} losses.\",\"standings_match_2nd_half_6\":\"{team_b} - Analysis of 2nd half performance\",\"standings_match_2nd_half_5\":\"{team_a} has played in {team_a_mp_overall} matches thus far in this {competition_name} campaign, and this is their record when only counting the 2nd half of those matches: {team_a_win_overall} wins, {team_a_draw_overall} draws, and {team_a_lose_overall} losses.\",\"standings_match_2nd_half_4\":\"{team_a} - Analysis of 2nd half performance\",\"standings_match_2nd_half_3\":\"To find out how \u003ca href=\\\"{team_a_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a}\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\\\"{team_b_url}\\\"\u003e{team_b}\u003c/a\u003e have performed just in the second half of their matches thus far in the competition, let’s take a look at some of their numbers:\",\"standings_match_over_under_goals_6\":\"The over/under goal analysis for \u003ca href=\\\"{match_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a} vs {team_b}\u003c/a\u003e offers valuable insights into each club's playing styles as well as a reasonable estimation of goals we could see in the match.\",\"standings_match_over_under_goals_7\":\"However, predicting the number of goals in a match does not always go the way the math says it will. It’s important to always consider other factors as well in order to get the best chance of making an accurate prediction.\",\"standings_match_btts_5\":\"Meanwhile, \u003cstrong\u003e{team_b} has scored and conceded in {team_b_btts_num_overall} of their {team_b_mp_overall} matches\u003c/strong\u003e so far in the {competition_name}, giving them a \u003cstrong\u003eBTTS rate of {team_b_btts_percentage_overall}%.\u003c/strong\u003e Both teams have scored in {team_b_btts_num_home} of {team_b}’s {team_b_mp_home} home matches, and it has happened {team_b_btts_num_away} times in {team_b_mp_away} matches as the away side.\",\"standings_match_btts_6\":\"It’s important to consider BTTS statistics when analysing teams as they provide insight into the teams’ overall approach and performance in matches. Teams with a high percentage of both teams scoring usually have more attacking approaches, whilst a lower rate of both teams scoring could point to a slightly more conservative gameplan for the most part.\",\"standings_match_btts_7\":\"And of course, this information should prove quite valuable when picking bets on the “Both Teams to Score” market and other goal-related markets\",\"standings_match_2nd_half_2\":\"Studying second-half stats greatly helps in measuring teams’ performances after half-time. The second half is the time in the match when coaches make adjustments to their strategies and players put it all on the line.\",\"standings_match_2nd_half_1\":\"This is the section to turn to for those searching for statistics on second-half performances in the {competition_name}. These stats make it possible to better analyse teams’ play in the last 45 minutes of a match.\",\"standings_match_1st_half_8\":\"The first half is when teams look to implement their initial gameplan for the match. So analysing a team's statistics in the first half of a football match can help whether they have been effective in getting the early advantage through those tactics.\",\"standings_match_1st_half_7\":\"Here, you can also find other important statistics such as goals scored and goals conceded at home, away, and overall in the first half. These stats can give you a clearer image of the two teams’ offensive and defensive capabilities in the first half, whether they’re playing as the hosts or the visitors.\",\"standings_match_cleansheet_3\":\"\u003ca href=\\\"{team_a_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a}\u003c/a\u003e has played {team_a_mp_overall} matches and kept opponents from scoring a single goal in {team_a_num_cs_overall} of them. In other words, \u003cstrong\u003ethey have kept a clean sheet in {team_a_percentage_cs_overall}% of their matches.\u003c/strong\u003e\",\"standings_match_1st_half_6\":\"For {team_b}, in their {team_b_mp_overall} matches played, their record over the first 45 minutes of the match is: {team_b_win_overall} wins, {team_b_draw_overall} draws, and {team_b_lose_overall} losses.\",\"standings_match_scoring_conceding_1\":\"This page keeps track of the number of matches a team has scored or conceded the first goal in a match. This helps give you a better idea of what to expect from \u003ca href=\\\"{team_a_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a}\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\\\"{team_b_url}\\\"\u003e{team_b}\u003c/a\u003e in terms of their tendencies from both an attacking and defensive perspective.\",\"standings_match_over_under_goals_5\":\"You can also see whether {team_a} and {team_b} matches go over or under a total number of goals when playing at home, away, or overall in {competition_name}.\",\"standings_match_over_under_goals_4\":\"You can also check how many times the total has gone under. In {team_b}’s case, {team_b_percentage_15_overall} of their matches have seen under 1.5 goals scored. And in terms of matches with \u003cstrong\u003eunder 2.5 goals, the rate is {team_b_percentage_25_overall}.\u003c/strong\u003e\",\"standings_match_over_under_goals_3\":\"{team_a_percentage_15_overall} of {team_a}’s matches in the {competition_name} have had more than 1.5 goals scored. And when we raise the line of \u003cstrong\u003etotal goals to 2.5, then the rate of matches that go over that number is {team_a_percentage_25_overall}.\u003c/strong\u003e\",\"standings_match_over_under_goals_2\":\"Here is an example of what we mean:\",\"standings_match_over_under_goals_1\":\"You can check out how often \u003ca href=\\\"{team_a_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a}\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\\\"{team_b_url}\\\"\u003e{team_b}\u003c/a\u003e matches in the \u003ca href=\\\"{competition_url}\\\"\u003e{competition_name}\u003c/a\u003e go over or under a certain number of goals on this page. This is a handy tool to help predict how many goals they could potentially score when they meet in their upcoming match.\",\"standings_match_2nd_half_9\":\"So while it’s important to study matches over the course of the full 90 minutes, analysis of the final 45 minutes can show a different perspective in terms of the teams’ performance in the competition.\",\"standings_match_cleansheet_5\":\"In {team_b_mp_away} home matches played in the {competition_name}, \u003ca href=\\\"{team_b_url}\\\"\u003e{team_b}\u003c/a\u003e has had {team_b_num_cs_away} matches without conceding a single goal. And away from home, they have a {team_b_percentage_cs_away}% clean sheet rate as the visiting side.\",\"standings_match_cleansheet_6\":\"If both clubs have a high rate of keeping clean sheets, then there’s a decent chance of seeing a low-scoring battle between two strong defensive clubs. But for matches between clubs with low rates of clean sheets, then it’s fair to expect a goal or two.\",\"standings_match_btts_1\":\"This section shows the statistics on how many times {team_a} and {team_b} have both scored and conceded in the same match in the \u003ca href=\\\"{competition_url}\\\"\u003e{competition_name}.\u003c/a\u003e\",\"standings_match_btts_2\":\"The “Both Teams to Score” stat is a good data point to use for seeing whether or not a match will feature many (or any) goals. If both teams have a high rate of both scoring and conceding goals, then there is a good chance that a couple of goals will go in. But if one or both teams have low BTTS rates, then their match could be a lower-scoring affair.\",\"standings_match_table_7\":\"Now, when playing away from home, {team_b} adds:\",\"standings_match_table_6\":\"As a result, {team_b} has, in terms of the overall campaign, \u003cb\u003ethe {team_b_positionth} position on the leaderboard\u003c/b\u003e. When {team_b} plays as home team, the situation is as follows: {team_b_match_played_home} games, {team_b_win_home} wins, {team_b_draw_home} draws and {team_b_lose_home} losses.\",\"standings_match_table_5\":\"As for \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"{team_b_url}\\\"\u003e{team_b}’s\u003c/a\u003e campaign, \u003c/strong\u003ethey sit in \u003cstrong\u003e{team_b_position} in the competition table\u003c/strong\u003e and this is the current state of their {competition_name} campaign:\",\"standings_match_table_4\":\"If we only look at \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"{team_a_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a}\u003c/a\u003e’s away matches\u003c/strong\u003e, this is their current record:\",\"standings_match_table_3\":\"Here are more stats from {team_a}’s campaign at home in the {competition_name} below:\",\"standings_match_table_2\":\"The club has picked up {team_a_points_overall} points (adding up all matches, including knockout matches). So based on points per match, they have picked up {team_a_ppg_overall} points per match to date in the tournament.\",\"standings_match_table_1\":\"At the moment, \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href\\\"{team_a_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a}\u003c/a\u003e is in {team_a_rank} in the \u003ca href=\\\"{competition_url}\\\"\u003e{competition_name}\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/strong\u003e In {team_a_match_played_overall} matches, {team_a} has {team_a_win_overall} wins, {team_a_draw_overall} draws, and {team_a_lose_overall} losses.\",\"losees\":\"losses\",\"opportunities\":\"opportunities\",\"opportunity\":\"opportunity\",\"games\":\"games\",\"game\":\"game\",\"clashes\":\"clashes\",\"standings_match_goals_8\":\"Defensively, \u003cstrong\u003e{team_a} has conceded {team_a_conceded_num_overall} goals\u003c/strong\u003e in {team_a_match_played_overall} matches, giving them an \u003cstrong\u003eaverage of {team_a_conceded_avg_overall} goals conceded per match.\u003c/strong\u003e\",\"standings_match_goals_9\":\"At home, {team_a} has given up {team_a_conceded_num_home} goals in {team_a_match_played_home} matches for an average of {team_a_conceded_avg_home} goals conceded per home match.\",\"standings_match_goals_17\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e{team_b}’s defence has let in a total of {team_b_conceded_num_overall} goals\u003c/strong\u003e in {team_b_match_played_overall} matches thus far. As a result, \u003cstrong\u003ethey are averaging {team_b_conceded_avg_overall} goals conceded per match.\u003c/strong\u003e\",\"standings_match_goals_10\":\"And away from home, their record is {team_a_conceded_num_away} goals given up in {team_a_match_played_away} matches, resulting in {team_a_conceded_avg_away} goals conceded per away contest.\",\"standings_match_goals_11\":\"For {team_b}, this is how many goals they have scored and conceded:\",\"standings_match_goals_12\":\"Goals scored - {team_b} in {competition_name}\",\"standings_match_goals_13\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e{team_b} has scored {team_b_scored_num_overall} goals\u003c/strong\u003e in {team_b_match_played_overall} matches played, giving them an \u003cstrong\u003eaverage of {team_b_scored_avg_overall} goals scored per match\u003c/strong\u003e in this campaign.\",\"standings_match_goals_14\":\"As the away team, {team_b} has scored {team_b_scored_num_away} times in {team_b_match_played_away} for an average of {team_b_scored_avg_away} goals scored per match.\",\"standings_match_goals_15\":\"And at their home ground, {team_b} has {team_b_scored_num_home} in {team_b_match_played_home} home matches, which comes out to an average of {team_b_scored_avg_home} goals scored per match.\",\"standings_match_goals_16\":\"Goals conceded - {team_b} in {competition_name}\",\"standings_match_goals_18\":\"Away from home, {team_b} has conceded {team_b_conceded_num_away} goals in {team_b_match_played_away} matches. That gives them an average of {team_b_conceded_avg_away} goals given up per away match.\",\"standings_match_goals_19\":\"On home soil, meanwhile, {team_b} has the following stats: {team_b_match_played_home} matches, {team_b_conceded_num_home} goals surrendered for an average of {team_b_conceded_avg_home} goals conceded per match.\",\"standings_match_corners_1\":\"The average number of corners for \u003ca href=\\\"{match_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a} vs {team_b}\u003c/a\u003e can greatly help your analysis of the match, as it can point to the attacking tendencies of both teams over the course of the campaign.\",\"standings_match_corners_2\":\"Matches involving \u003ca href=\\\"{team_a_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a}\u003c/a\u003e have \u003cstrong\u003eaveraged {team_a_corner_avg_overall} corners per match\u003c/strong\u003e during this {competition_name} campaign. They have taken {team_a_corner_for_avg_overall} corners per match, while they concede an average of {team_a_corner_against_avg_overall} to their opponents.\",\"standings_match_corners_3\":\"As for their upcoming opponent, \u003ca href=\\\"{team_b_url}\\\"\u003e{team_b}\u003c/a\u003e, their corner stats are the following:\",\"standings_match_corners_4\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eAverage number of corners in matches involving {team_b}: {team_b_corner_avg_overall}\u003c/strong\u003e\",\"standings_match_corners_5\":\"Average number of corners in favour: {team_b_corner_for_avg_overall}\",\"standings_match_corners_6\":\"Average number of corners conceded: {team_b_corner_against_avg_overall}\",\"standings_match_corners_7\":\"Corners can be a valuable statistic to look into when looking at a particular match like \u003ca href=\\\"{match_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a} vs {team_b}\u003c/a\u003e. Examining the average number of corners helps measure the offensive intent of both teams since being on the opposition half of the pitch increases the chances of winning more corners.\",\"standings_match_corners_8\":\"Corners conceded stats can also shed more light on a team’s defence and how they can capably prevent their opponents from having the ball in dangerous areas on the pitch.\",\"standings_match_1st_half_3\":\"{team_a} - 1st half performance in {competition_name}\",\"standings_match_cards_1\":\"Check out all the card statistics for \u003ca href=\\\"{match_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a} vs {team_b}\u003c/a\u003e here. Studying the number of cards a team receives over the course of a match and a season gives a good sense of a team’s level of discipline.\",\"standings_match_1st_half_4\":\"{team_a} has played a total of {team_a_mp_overall} matches so far, and here is the team’s first-half record in those matches: {team_a_win_overall} wins, {team_a_draw_overall} draws, and {team_a_lose_overall} losses.\",\"standings_match_1st_half_5\":\"{team_b} - 1st half performance in {competition_name}\",\"standings_match_1st_half_2\":\"So let’s take a look at how \u003ca href=\\\"{team_a_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a}\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\\\"{team_b_url}\\\"\u003e{team_b}\u003c/a\u003e have played in the first half of their matches.\",\"standings_match_1st_half_1\":\"To find out which team does better in the first half of \u003ca href=\\\"{competition_url}\\\"\u003e{competition_name}\u003c/a\u003e matches, look no further. This section of APWin’s football statistics platform allows you to check which teams have been the best and the worst in the opening 45 minutes.\",\"standings_match_cards_6\":\"And if you'd like to learn more about the card averages of these two teams or other clubs in the {competition_name}, just check out the table above.\",\"standings_match_cards_5\":\"Card statistics for {team_a} vs {team_b} bring a different angle for analysing the match. It offers a deeper look at the dynamics during their matches and highlights the two club's potential problems when it comes to possibly going a man down.\",\"standings_match_cards_4\":\"Meanwhile, \u003ca href=\\\"{team_b_url}\\\"\u003e{team_b}\u003c/a\u003e has, in {team_b_mp_overall} matches to date, had more than 1.5 bookings in {team_b_cards_for_15_percentage_overall} of their matches. They have had over 2.5 cards in {team_b_cards_for_25_percentage_overall} of matches and have seen more than 3.5 cards in {team_b_cards_for_35_percentage_overall} of matches.\",\"standings_match_cards_3\":\"\u003ca href=\\\"{team_a_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a}\u003c/a\u003e has played {team_a_mp_overall} matches in the \u003ca href=\\\"{competition_url}\\\"\u003e{competition_name}\u003c/a\u003e and has received more than 1.5 cards (yellow and red) in {team_a_cards_for_15_percentage_overall} of those matches. They have also received over 2.5 bookings in {team_a_cards_for_25_percentage_overall} of matches and over 3.5 cards in {team_a_cards_for_35_percentage_overall} of matches.\",\"standings_match_cards_2\":\"For this match, the card stat situation of both teams is as follows:\",\"standings_match_goals_7\":\"Goals conceded - {team_a} in {competition_name}\",\"standings_match_goals_6\":\"And as the visiting side, {team_a} has {team_a_scored_num_away} goals scored in {team_a_match_played_away} away matches for an average of {team_a_scored_avg_away} goals scored per away match.\",\"standings_match_goals_5\":\"As the home side, {team_a} has scored {team_a_scored_num_home} goals in their {team_a_match_played_home} home matches in the {competition_name}, resulting in {team_a_scored_avg_home} goals per match at home.\",\"standings_match_goals_4\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e{team_a} has scored {team_a_scored_num_overall} goals\u003c/strong\u003e in {team_a_match_played_overall} matches \u003cstrong\u003efor an average of {team_a_scored_avg_overall} goals scored per match.\u003c/strong\u003e\",\"standings_match_goals_3\":\"Goals scored - {team_a} in {competition_name}\",\"standings_match_goals_2\":\"In terms of how {team_a} has performed with scoring and conceding goals in the {competition_name}, here’s a quick summary:\",\"standings_match_goals_1\":\"This section breaks down the goal statistics of \u003ca href=\\\"{team_a_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a}\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\\\"{team_b_url}\\\"\u003e{team_b}\u003c/a\u003e in the \u003ca href=\\\"{competition_url}\\\"\u003e{competition_name}.\u003c/a\u003e This information is crucial in better understanding how the two teams’ offences and defences have performed during the current campaign.\",\"standings_match_table_9\":\"With this data, you can check each club’s goal production, their position in the table, their goal difference, and other factors that can be useful for predicting the outcome of the match.\",\"standings_match_table_8\":\"The competition table helps provide an overview of the teams’ performance during the current campaign and helps identify patterns, trends, and statistics relevant to analysing \u003ca href=\\\"{match_url}\\\"\u003e{team_a} vs {team_b}.\u003c/a\u003e\",\"tomorrow_5\":\"And remember that we built this whole platform so that you can find this information for free and use it to help you make more informed betting decisions. So if that is the case, good luck and we hope to see you back on APWin tomorrow!\",\"yesterday_4\":\"As always, we work hard to give you not only the scores from yesterday’s matches but also detailed statistics like the Ball Possession, Corners, Shots on Targets, etc.\",\"yesterday_1\":\"APWin brings you football data, analytics and statistics from over 10.000 matches that happen worldwide over the course of a month.\",\"yesterday_2\":\"And here you can find \u003cb\u003eyesterday’s football results\u003c/b\u003e in the {competitions} and much more.\",\"today_1\":\"If you are looking for a page and platform that covers all \u003cb\u003efootball matches today\u003c/b\u003e, look no further, as APWin has got you covered.\",\"today_2\":\"Are you just looking for the time for when the match {teams_1} starts? Or more in-depth information like the recent results of {teams_2}? The corner statistics from {teams_3}, or who between {teams_4} is in better form regarding expected goals?\",\"yesterday_7\":\"Please note that if you are looking for matches that happened late at night or early morning, they can be classified as Today’s matches since they may have started after 00:00. Good luck, and as always, thanks for trusting APWin!\",\"yesterday_6\":\"As always, we hope that APWin is your one-stop shop for everything related to football analytics and that you can use that information to make better football betting decisions.\",\"yesterday_5\":\"You probably know that the score of the match {teams} was {score}. But do you know how many shots on target or yellow cards each team had? If you don’t know and that is the kind of information you are looking for, you have come to the right place.\",\"yesterday_3\":\"On this page, you will be able to find match results from the match between {teams} and much, much more.\",\"tomorrow_4\":\"What do you think will happen, for example, between {teams}? The home team has {w_d_l_1} its last match while {team_2} ended up {w_d_l_2} with a final score of {score_2}.\",\"tomorrow_3\":\"{league_1}, {league_2} and {league_3} are some of the competitions that will see some of their most important teams fighting for the win. APWin has got you covered, from the date and time of the matches to the Cards or Offsides each time has gotten leading up to tomorrow’s game.\",\"tomorrow_2\":\"Tomorrow we will have plenty of entertainment, and some of the highlights are {teams_1}, {teams_2} and obviously the match {teams_3}. A few of these teams get to the match in different forms with opposite results in the past matches, but we expect competitive fights to see who gets the 3 points.\",\"tomorrow_1\":\"The day is not over yet, but you are already looking for tomorrow’s matches? Look no further, as we will have plenty of entertainment and betting opportunities in \u003cb\u003efootball tomorrow\u003c/b\u003e. You can find teams from all over the world facing each other in the fight for the 3 points. \",\"today_5\":\"You can find all this and much more on APWin’s free platform, made from football fanatics for football fanatics. And, if you decide to place a bet on any matches today, good luck!\",\"today_4\":\"We have some important matches happening today, with lots of action around the world that you can access at your fingertips.\",\"today_3\":\"No matter what you are looking for, we cover over 300 leagues to deliver you, at no cost, all the information you may need from Today’s matches. Whether or not you are looking for this information to place a bet.\",\"worse\":\"worse\",\"excellent\":\"excellent\",\"average\":\"average\",\"bad\":\"bad\",\"good\":\"good\",\"medium\":\"medium\",\"poor\":\"poor\",\"same\":\"same\",\"better\":\"better\",\"lost\":\"lost\",\"more_about_league\":\"More About {league}\",\"match_draw\":\"match ended\",\"match_draw_2\":\"matches ended\",\"yellow cards\":\"yellow cards\",\"assist\":\"assist\",\"yellow card\":\"yellow card\",\"card\":\"card\",\"trends_p_1\":\"Check out the latest football trends, combining the most exciting matches today with leading statistics to help you make more money with football betting!\",\"time\":\"time\",\"more_about_leagues\":\"More About Leagues\",\"loss\":\"loss\",\"who_is_player\":\"Who is {name}?\",\"what_is_the_contribution_answer_attacker\":\"{name} has scored {goals_scored} this season and made {assist} in {mp} this season. This means that he has {goals_90_min} goals per 90’, and {assists_90_min} assists per match. He received a total of {card} (Yellow and Red) which is the equivalent of {cards_90_min} cards per 90’.\",\"losses\":\"losses\",\"more_about_trends\":\"More about Trends\",\"points\":\"points\",\"who_is_the_top_scorer_answer_1\":\"In {competition}, {team} has {goals}. {player_goals} of the goals were scored by their top scorer, \u003ca href=\\\"{url}\\\"\u003e{player_name}\u003c/a\u003e. \",\"goal\":\"goal\",\"more_about_player\":\"More about {name}\",\"trends_p_3\":\"We pick out the key points from the biggest matches to help you build stronger selections. Our betting tips cover popular markets such as Over 2.5 Goals, Both Teams to Score, Home 