ey have scored {goals} and conceded {conceded}.\",\"worst_attack_answer_1\":\"{team} has the worst attack of {name}. They have only scored {goals} in {mp} and average {goals_avg} goals scored per match this season.\",\"where_is_the_match_answer_no_standing\":\"The Match between {team_a} and {team_b} takes place at the home of {team_a}, in {date}, at {time}. The match is part of the {game_week} round of the {competition}. The match will will take place at the {stadium_name}.\",\"worst_attack_answer_2\":\"At home, {team_a} has the worst attack in {name}. They have played {mp} at home and scored only {goals}. They average {goals_avg} goals scored at home, which is worse than {team_b} with an average of {team_b_avg_goals} and {team_c}'s average of {team_c_avg_goals}, which have the 2nd and 3rd worst attack. \",\"best_attack_answer_2\":\"At home, {team_a} has the best attack in {name}. They have played {mp} at home and scored {goals}. They average {goals_avg} at home, which puts them ahead of {team_b}, who averages {team_b_avg_goals} and {team_c} who averages {team_c_avg_goals}, which are the 2nd and 3rd best attackers.\",\"what_is_the_performance_answer\":\"{team} is in {team_standing} place in the {competition}. They have played {mp}, with a total of {win}, {draw} and {loss}. {team} averages {ppg} Points Per Match in the {competition} with a total of {total_goals} scored and {total_conceded} conceded.\",\"what_are_standing_answer_1\":\"{name} is currently in {position} place in {competition}. They have {points} in {mp}, which averages {ppg} points per match. From the {mp} played, they have won {win}, drawn {draw} and lost {lose}. They have scored {goals} and conceded {conceded}.\",\"played_at_home\":\"Playing at home, {team} is currently at {team_standing} place. They have played {mp} in total with {win}, {draw} and {loss}. {team} averages {ppg} Points Per Match in {competition} at home with {total_goals} scored and {total_conceded} conceded.\",\"what_are_next_matches_