 against {opponent}. They have {w_d_l} the match {result}, which means they are currently sitting in {position} place in {competition}.\",\"leader_home\":\"At home, the leader of {name} is {team}, which has {points} in {mp} played. They have won {win}, drawn {draw} and lost {lose}. They have scored {goals} and conceded {conceded}. They average {ppg} points per game when playing at home.\",\"who_has_best_attack\":\"Who has the best attack in {name}?\",\"leader_answer_2\":\"{team_a} is currently {diff} ahead of {team_b}, which is currently 2nd, and {diff_2} ahead of {team_c}, which is currently 3rd.\",\"click_next_matches\":\"Click \u003ca href=\\\"#match-schedule\\\" class=\\\"btn-next-matches\\\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e to see more about next matches.\",\"click_past_results\":\"Click \u003ca href=\\\"#matches\\\" class=\\\"btn-matches\\\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e to see more about Past Results.\",\"what_is_the_h2h_answer\":\"In the past five years, {team_a} and {team_b} have played {time} against each other. {team_a} has won {team_a_win}, and {team_b} has won {team_b_win} with {draw} in a draw.\",\"leader_answer_1\":\"This season, {team} is leading the {name}, with {points} in {mp} played. They have an average of {ppg} points per match. They have won {win}, drawn {draw} and lost {lost}.\",\"leader_away\":\"Away, the leader of {name} is {team}, which has {points} in {mp} played. They have won {win}, drawn {draw} and lost {lose}. They have scored {goals} and conceded {conceded}. They average {ppg} points per game when playing away.\",\"what_are_the_results_answer\":\"The \u003ca href=\\\"{url}\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003elast match\u003c/a\u003e in {name} was on {date_time}. {team_a} received {team_b}, and the game ended in {result}. This means that {team_a} is currently in {team_a_standing} place with {team_a_point_win} won, and {team_b} is currently in {team_b_standing} place with {team_b_point_win}.\",\"what_is_league\":\"What is {name}?\",\"played_at_home_no_standing\":\"Playing at home, {team} have played {mp} in total with {win}, {draw} and {loss}. {team} averages {ppg} Points Per Match in {competition} at home with {total_goals} scored and {total_conceded} conceded.\",\"more_about_team\":\"More about {name}\",\"what_is_the_h2h\":\"Head 2 Head between {team_a} and {team_b}\",\"what_is_the_h2h_answer_2\":\"When the match is played at {stadium_name}, there were {team_a_win} for {team_a}, {team_b_win} for {team_b} and {draw} in a draw.\",\"where_is_the_match\":\"When and where is the Match for {team_a} vs {team_b}\",\"what_is_the_performance\":\"{team} Performance\",\"best_attack_answer_1\":\"{team} has the best attack of {name}. They have scored {goals} in {mp} this season and average {goals_avg} goals scored per match.\",\"what_are_the_results\":\"What are the {name} Results?\"},\"bookies_text\":{\"intro\":{\"paragraph2\":\"With so many betting sites to choose from, picking the right one can be a daunting task.\",\"paragraph3\":\"This guide is here to help you navigate the online betting landscape, providing tips on how to find reliable platforms, the key features to look for, and ensuring that your betting experience remains both safe and enjoyable.\",\"paragraph1\":\"Online betting has grown significantly in recent years, offering you a wide range of options for placing bets.\",\"title\":\"The Best Online Betting Sites\"},\"section4\":{\"paragraph2\":\"By selecting a trusted, licensed site that offers a great user experience, you can dive into the exciting world of online betting with confidence.\",\"paragraph1\":\"The world of online betting is vast, with a wide variety of platforms to choose from. To ensure a safe, enjoyable, and rewarding betting experience, it’s essential to focus on key factors like licensing, security, competitive odds, and excellent customer support.\",\"title\":\"Final Thoughts\"},\"section3\":{\"subs\":{\"paragraph2\":\"Many leading betting sites also offer \u003ca href=\\\"https://www.apwin.com/streams/\\\"\u003elive streaming of football matches\u003c/a\u003e. This allows you to watch the action unfold directly on the platform while placing bets. Combining live betting with live streaming creates a thrilling, all-in-one experience.\",\"paragraph1\":\"Live betting, or in-play betting, is a feature that many top betting sites offer. This allows you to place bets on events that are already in progress, giving you the chance to adjust your wagers as the game evolves. The excitement of live betting makes the experience even more immersive, especially if you can react to game developments in real-time.\",\"title\":\"Live Betting and Streaming\"},\"paragraph2\":\"Below you can find the qualities that set the top betting sites apart:\",\"paragraph1\":\"In addition to the basics like security, odds, and customer support, the best betting platforms offer additional features that enhance your experience.\",\"title\":\"Features of Top Betting Sites\"},\"section2\":{\"subs\":{\"paragraph2\":\"The best betting sites offer clear and fair bonus structures, so you know exactly what to expect. Look for sites that provide transparent terms to avoid confusion or disappointment later on. Do note that bonuses may not be available in your country. Some countries may have restricted bonuses by law.\",\"paragraph1\":\"One of the most attractive aspects of online betting is the range of bonuses and promotions available. Many betting sites offer welcome bonuses, free bets, reload bonuses, and loyalty rewards. These promotions can provide great value, but it’s essential to read the fine print. Always check the terms and conditions of bonuses to understand the wagering requirements, minimum odds, and other restrictions before claiming any offers.\",\"title\":\"Bonuses and Promotions\"},\"paragraph2\":\"Here at APWin we have shortlisted the most important aspects to look for. When we add a bookmaker to our site, we make sure that it checks all the criteria mentioned below.\",\"paragraph1\":\"Choosing the right online betting site comes down to a combination of factors, including security, user experience, payment options, odds, and customer support.\",\"title\":\"How to Choose a Reliable Betting Site?\"},\"section1\":{\"paragraph3\":\"By choosing a site that holds a valid license, you can be confident that it adheres to the strict standards set by these authorities, offering a safer experience for you.\",\"paragraph2\":\"Licensed online bookmakers operate under the authority of regulatory bodies, such as the UK Gambling Commission, the Malta Gaming Authority, or the Curacao eGaming License. These agencies enforce rules that protect you as a player and maintain the integrity of the betting environment.\",\"paragraph1\":\"The legality of online betting depends entirely on where you are located. In many parts of the world, online betting is legal and regulated, ensuring that players can enjoy a fair, transparent, and secure experience. However, in some countries or regions, online betting may be restricted or even outright prohibited. Always make sure to check the local laws in your jurisdiction before placing any bets.\",\"title\":\"Are Online Betting Sites Legal?\"}},\"cookies\":{\"defaults\":{\"_ga_ID\":\"Used by Google Analytics to persist session state.\",\"_gid\":\"Used by Google Analytics to identify the user.\",\"_gat\":\"Used by Google Analytics to throttle the request rate.\",\"_ga\":\"Main cookie used by Google Analytics, enables a service to distinguish one visitor from another.\",\"csrf\":\"Used to secure both the user and our website against cross-site request forgery attacks.\",\"consent\":\"Used to store the user's cookie consent preferences.\",\"session\":\"Used to identify the user's browsing session.\"},\"customize\":\"Customize\",\"minute\":\"Minute|Minutes\",\"year\":\"Year|Years\",\"link_text\":\"Take a look at our \u003ca href=\\\"{url}\\\"\u003eCookies Policy\u003c/a\u003e for more information.\",\"duration\":\"Duration\",\"purpose\":\"Purpose\",\"cookie\":\"Cookie\",\"details\":{\"more\":\"More details\",\"less\":\"Less details\"},\"categories\":{\"essentials\":{\"title\":\"Essential cookies\",\"description\":\"There are some cookies that we have to include in order for certain web pages to function. For this reason, they do not require your consent.\"},\"optional\":{\"description\":\"These cookies enable features that could improve your user experience, but their absence will not impact your ability to browse our website.\",\"title\":\"Optional cookies\"},\"analytics\":{\"title\":\"Analytics cookies\",\"description\":\"We use these for internal research on how we can improve the service we provide for all our users. These cookies assess how you interact with our website.\"}},\"manage\":\"Manage cookies\",\"hour\":\"Hour|Hours\",\"day\":\"Day|Days\",\"save\":\"Save settings\",\"all\":\"Accept all\",\"essentials\":\"Only essentials\",\"intro\":\"This website uses cookies in order to enhance the overall user experience.\",\"title\":\"We use cookies\",\"What are cookies\":\"What are cookies?\",\"3rd party Cookies\":\"3rd party Cookies\",\"Website preference cookies\":\"Website preference cookies\",\"Periodically, we offer searches\":\"From time to time, we may run surveys and questionnaires to learn more about our users and improve the tools and information we provide. We may use cookies to remember who has taken part and to make sure the results remain accurate as you move between pages.\",\"This website uses Google Analytics\":\"This website uses Google Analytics, which is one of the solutions for analytics more widely used and trusted on the internet, to help us how you interact with the website and how we can improve your experience. These cookies can monitor items such as how long you’re on the website for and the pages visited, so that we can continue producing content tailored to you.\",\"As it is common practice in almost\":\"Like most professional websites, APWin uses cookies to improve your experience. Cookies are small files stored on your device that help the website work properly and remember certain information. This page explains what information cookies collect, how we use it and why some cookies are necessary. It also explains how you can disable cookies, although doing so may affect some features and functions of the website.\",\"We use cookies for several reasons\":\"We use cookies for several reasons, as explained below. In most cases, disabling cookies can affect how the website works and may prevent some features from working properly. If you’re not sure whether you need to disable them, we recommend keeping cookies enabled to ensure you can use all the services and features available on APWin.\",\"When you give us data through\":\"When you submit information through a form, such as a contact or comment form, we may use cookies to remember your details. This means you won’t have to enter the same information again the next time you use the form.\",\"To provide you the best experience\":\"To give you the best experience on APWin, we may use cookies to remember your preferences. This allows the website to work according to your settings and provide a more personalised experience whenever you visit and interact with different pages.\",\"For more information regarding cookies\":\"For more information about Google Analytics cookies, please visit the official Google Analytics page.\",\"This website offers subscription\":\"When you log in, we use cookies to keep you signed in as you move around the website. This means you won’t have to log in again when opening different pages. These cookies are usually removed when you log out to help protect your account and keep restricted areas secure.\",\"The 3rd party analyses are used to monitor\":\"We use third-party analytics to monitor how people use the website and help us keep improving it. These cookies collect information such as how long you spend on the site and which pages you visit, helping us understand what works and improve your overall experience.\",\"We use cookies when you are logged in\":\"When you’re logged in, we use cookies to remember your session. This means you don’t have to log in every time you visit a new page. These cookies are normally removed when you log out to help keep your account and restricted areas secure.\",\"If you create an account with us\":\"If you create an account with us, we use cookies to manage the registration process and your account settings. These cookies are usually removed when you log out, although some may remain to remember your preferences when you return to the website.\",\"Cookies related to the Account\":\"Cookies related to the Account\",\"Cookies related to Login\":\"Cookies related to Login\",\"Cookies related to your email\":\"Cookies related to your email\",\"You can avoid the cookies by changing\":\"You can disable cookies by changing your browser settings. Check your browser’s help section for instructions on how to do this. However, disabling cookies may affect how APWin and other websites work and could limit access to certain features. For the best experience, we recommend keeping cookies enabled.\",\"Cookies related to searches\":\"Cookies related to searches\",\"In some special cases\":\"In some cases, we also use cookies from trusted third parties. The section below explains which third-party cookies may be used on the APWin website.\",\"Cookies related to formularies\":\"Cookies related to formularies\",\"How do we use cookies\":\"How does APWin use cookies?\",\"Periodically, we test new resources\":\"Periodically, we test new resources and make changes in the way the website is shown. When we are still testing new resources, those cookies can be used to guarantee that you receive an experience consistent while on the website, along with understand which optimizations are preferred by users.\",\"More information\":\"More information\",\"We hope that you are clarified\":\"We hope that you are clarified and, as mentioned before, if there’s anything you are not sure if you need or not, it’s generally better to have the cookies activated, if they interfere with any of the website features. \",\"This policy is valid as of July 2020\":\"This policy is valid as of July 2020\",\"Cookies Settings\":\"Cookies Settings\",\"Disable Cookies\":\"Disable Cookies\"},\"team\":{\"Lesotho\":\"Lesotho\",\"Albania\":\"Albania\",\"Ivory Coast\":\"Ivory Coast\",\"Kenya\":\"Kenya\",\"Algeria\":\"Algeria\",\"Mozambique\":\"Mozambique\",\"Somalia\":\"Somalia\",\"Rwanda\":\"Rwanda\",\"Central African Republic\":\"Central African Republic\",\"Mauritania\":\"Mauritania\",\"Guinea\":\"Guinea\",\"Uganda\":\"Uganda\",\"Libya\":\"Libya\",\"Burkina Faso\":\"Burkina Faso\",\"Egypt\":\"Egypt\",\"Mali\":\"Mali\",\"Madagascar\":\"Madagascar\",\"Congo DR\":\"Congo DR\",\"Cape Verde Islands\":\"Cape Verde Islands\",\"Benin\":\"Benin\",\"Niger\":\"Niger\",\"Gabon\":\"Gabon\",\"Étoile du Congo\":\"Étoile du Congo\",\"Puerto Rico\":\"Puerto Rico\",\"Curaçao\":\"Curaçao\",\"Turks and Caicos Islands\":\"Turks and Caicos Islands\",\"Barbados\":\"Barbados\",\"Dominica\":\"Dominica\",\"Dominican Republic\":\"Dominican Republic\",\"Cuba\":\"Cuba\",\"Antigua and Barbuda\":\"Antigua and Barbuda\",\"Trinidad and Tobago\":\"Trinidad and Tobago\",\"Bermuda\":\"Bermuda\",\"St\":{\" Kitts and Nevis\":\"St. Kitts and Nevis\",\" Vincent / Grenadines\":\"St. Vincent / Grenadines\",\" Lucia\":\"St. Lucia\"},\"Nicaragua\":\"Nicaragua\",\"Guyana\":\"Guyana\",\"Grenada\":\"Grenada\",\"El Salvador\":\"El Salvador\",\"Guatemala\":\"Guatemala\",\"Suriname\":\"Suriname\",\"Belize\":\"Belize\",\"British Virgin Islands\":\"British Virgin Islands\",\"Bahamas\":\"Bahamas\",\"Anguilla\":\"Anguilla\",\"Cayman Islands\":\"Cayman Islands\",\"Montserrat\":\"Montserrat\",\"US Virgin Islands\":\"US Virgin Islands\",\"Aruba\":\"Aruba\",\"USMNT\":\"USMNT\",\"Honduras\":\"Honduras\",\"Tahiti\":\"Tahiti\",\"New Caledonia