l be shown by \u003ca href=\\\"{bookie_referrer}\\\"\u003ethis bookmaker\u003c/a\u003e. To watch, simply create an account at the bookmaker and make a minimum deposit. After following these steps, you can stream {team_a} vs {team_b} online.\",\"faq_match_answer_1\":\"You can watch {team_a} matches with the licensed bookmaker that has the rights to stream the games. Make an account and your first deposit and you can watch for free.\",\"faq_match_answer_4\":\"The clash between {team_a} vs {team_b}, on this day {date}, will be held at {hour} (UK time).\",\"faq_match_question_5\":\"Which site will show {team_a} vs {team_b}?\",\"faq_match_question_4\":\"What time is {team_a} vs {team_b} match today?\",\"faq_match_answer_3\":\"Today’s {team_a} vs {team_b} match will be streamed live by multiple other online sports betting sites.\",\"faq_match_question_3\":\"Where to watch {team_a} vs {team_b} today for free?\",\"faq_match_question_2\":\"Where to watch the {team_b} match?\",\"faq_league_answer_4\":\"To watch {competition_name} on your cell phone, simply download one of the apps from the streaming services that are entitled to show the championship or even create an account on an online betting site.\",\"faq_country_answer_1\":\"The top {country} matches are shown in the country online via streaming services and through betting sites (upon registration and making the first deposit).\",\"faq_country_question_2\":\"Which betting site shows {nationality} football matches?\",\"league_faq_title\":\"FAQ - {competition} Streaming\",\"faq_country_question_3\":\"What are the main matches today in {country}?\",\"faq_country_answer_3\":\"Today, in {country}, the main matches are: {matches_text}.\",\"league_title1\":\"{competition} {season}: Live Streaming of Matches\",\"league_paragraph1\":\"If you like watching {competition} {season} live, in this section you can follow all the matches of the day and find out where the {competition} matches will take place.\",\"faq_country_question_1\":\"How to watch a {nationality} football match?\",\"country_faq_description\":\"Here are the main questions about watching football live in {country}.\",\"country_faq_title\":\"FAQ - Streaming in {country}\",\"country_paragraph7\":\"With these options, you can enjoy and watch football live on the internet and TV.\",\"country_paragraph6\":\"\\n        \u003cul\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eYouTube\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eOther sports betting sites\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eAuthorised streaming\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eTV channels and cable TV services\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eApplications of the clubs involved\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eSocial media\u003c/li\u003e\\n        \u003c/ul\u003e\\n    \",\"country_paragraph5\":\"In addition to watching football for free in {country}, you can explore other streaming options and streaming services, such as:\",\"country_title2\":\"Other options for watching {country} football online\",\"country_paragraph4\":\"Important note: all ways of watching {country} matches are reliable and do not violate national laws. If you are in another country, check whether you are violating copyright laws, as this may present security risks.\",\"country_paragraph3\":\"For your experience to be positive, we recommend that you consider the streaming quality of the partner platform’s football live streams and the speed of your internet connection. With these options and precautions in mind, you should be able to watch football online for free.\",\"country_paragraph2\":\"\\n    \u003cp\u003eTo watch {nationality} football matches online, just follow these steps:\u003c/p\u003e\\n    \u003cul\u003e\\n        \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFind the match\u003c/strong\u003e you are interested in.\u003c/li\u003e\\n        \u003cli\u003eThen \u003cstrong\u003eclick on the icon to watch live.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n        \u003cli\u003eAfter that, you will be redirected to the partner bookmaker.\u003c/li\u003e\\n        \u003cli\u003eIf you don't have an account on the betting site that streams the match live, \u003cstrong\u003ecreate an account\u003c/strong\u003e and make your first deposit.\u003c/li\u003e\\n        \u003cli\u003eWith the account created, \u003cstrong\u003elog in\u003c/strong\u003e to the website.\u003c/li\u003e\\n        \u003cli\u003eOnce logged in, just find the match. Then \u003cstrong\u003eclick on the Live Streaming option\u003c/strong\u003e and watch the match.\u003c/li\u003e\\n    \u003c/ul\u003e\\n    \",\"league_paragraph2\":\"Therefore, if you want to follow all the emotions of this competition closely, this step-by-step guide will provide you with the necessary information to watch football live so you don't miss any of your favourite matches:\",\"country_paragraph1\":\"\\n    At APWin, you can watch football matches from all the different tiers of football in {country}, such as {competitions}. This way, fans of the most popular sport in the world can locate all the matches in this specific country and know how and where to watch each match.\\n    \",\"league_paragraph3\":\"\\n        \u003cul\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eFind the match you want to watch.\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eThen click the live stream button.\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eAfter that, a new screen will open and you will be redirected to \u003ca href='{link}'\u003eAPWin's\u003c/a\u003e partner betting site.\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eIf you do not have an account with the betting site broadcasting the game live, create an account and make the initial deposit.\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eAfter creating an account, log in to the website.\u003c/li\u003e\\n        \u003c/ul\u003e\\n        \u003cp\u003eOnce logged in, find the match and \u003cstrong\u003eclick on the \\\"Live Stream\\\"\u003c/strong\u003e option to watch the match in real time.\u003c/p\u003e\\n    \",\"league_paragraph4\":\"By following the guide above, you'll be ready to watch football online for free, root for your favourite team, and watch the best matchups during the {competition} {season}.\",\"country_title1\":\"{country}: Watch Live Matches from this country\",\"paragraph4\":\"It's worth remembering that the availability of live football streams may change, and it is important to \u003cstrong\u003erespect the copyright\u003c/strong\u003e and terms of use of digital streaming platforms. Always opt for legal methods to support your club and the sports industry.\",\"paragraph3\":\"$15\",\"league_paragraph6\":\"Other convenient ways to watch {competition} live are through sports streaming services and other options. Here are some popular options:\",\"paragraph2\":\"In addition to providing the complete list of channels that will show today’s games, APWin also allows you to watch football live and online in HD on mobile devices such as cell phones, tablets and even on your computer. Everything is directly connected to our website.\",\"paragraph1\":\"\u003ca href='{link}'\u003eAPWin\u003c/a\u003e delivers the \u003cstrong\u003etop options for watching football live and for free.\u003c/strong\u003e With the information on our platform, users who like to enjoy football live can know where they can watch today's games for free and follow their favourite team closely.\",\"title1\":\"Live Streams {date}\",\"league_paragraph5\":\"It is essential to highlight that all ways of enjoying the matches are legal and comply with the country's regulations. However, when in foreign territory, it is important to ensure that you do not violate copyright regulations, as this could pose a risk to your safety.\",\"league_paragraph7\":\"\\n            \u003cul\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eOpen and cable TV\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eApp for participating teams\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eYouTube\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eSocial media\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eOther sports betting houses\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003cli\u003eStreaming platforms authorised by the competition\u003c/li\u003e\\n            \u003c/ul\u003e\\n    \",\"faq_country_answer_2\":\"Many of the leading bookmakers in the {nationality} market stream {nationality} football matches.\",\"league_title2\":\"Streaming {competition} live: other options for watching\",\"faq_league_question_1\":\"How to watch {competition_name} for free?\",\"faq_league_answer_1\":\"It is possible to watch {competition_name} live online by creating an account on sports betting sites and making the first deposit.\",\"faq_league_question_2\":\"Where are the {competition_name} matches shown?\",\"faq_league_answer_2\":\"{competition_name} is broadcast on the main TV channels and internet streaming services. It is also possible to watch the matches in this competition through the various football live streams of online betting sites.\",\"faq_league_question_3\":\"Which betting site shows {competition_name} live?\",\"faq_league_answer_3\":\"Many of the leading bookmakers in the {nationality} market stream {nationality} football matches.\",\"faq_league_question_4\":\"Can you watch {competition_name} on your cell phone?\"},\"member\":{\"Verify Email\":\"Verify Email\",\"account_suspended\":\"Your account suspended\",\"Send Verification Email\":\"Send Verification Email\",\"Click Button Below To Verify\":\"Click Button Below To Verify\",\"oops_suspended\":\"Your account have been suspended because your email is not confirmed in over 3 days, You can click this button below to send the email verification.\",\"Verify Your Email\":\"Account created successfully! Please confirm your email\",\"We have resend the email2\":\"We have resent the email confirmation. If you can't still find it, please check your SPAM folder.\",\"Please Verify Your Email\":\"Hey {name}! Welcome to APWin, You can now enjoy unlimited access to our stats and predictions. Please confirm your account, check your email for the verification link.\",\"Please Verify Before Premium\":\"Oops! You need to verify your account before subscribing to our 7-day Premium Trial. Check your email inbox or click on the button below to send a new confirmation link:\",\"suspend_message\":\"Your account is inactive. Kindly confirm your email before logging in again. If you didn't receive an email with the confirmation link, you can send a new one by clicking the button below.\",\"try_premium_for_free2\":\"Your account is now active! Want to try Premium for FREE?\",\"Resend verification email\":\"Resend verification email\",\"Reactivate on Hotmart\":\"Reactivate on Hotmart\",\"Close\":\"Close\",\"hotmart_login_message\":\"Sorry, your premium is failed to be reactivated. Please login to your hotmart account and reactivate your premium or \u003ca href=\\\"{contact_url}\\\"\u003econtact us\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"create_bw_account\":\"Create BetWinner Account\",\"premium_subscription_expired\":\"Please reactivate your premium by \u003ca href=\\\"{url1}\\\"\u003eclicking here\u003c/a\u003e or if you have any questions feel free to \u003ca href=\\\"{url2}\\\"\u003econtact us\u003c/a\u003e\",\"Sorry, your premium failed to be reactivated\":\"Sorry, your premium is failed to be reactivated, please contact us\",\"Your premium has been successfully reactivated\":\"Your premium has been successfully reactivated\",\"You will be charged a one month premium\":\"You will be charged a one month premium\",\"You have activated your premium using partner\":\"You have activated your premium using partner\",\"Reactivate \u0026 Charge\":\"Reactivate \u0026 Charge\",\"Reactivate Your Premium\":\"Reactivate Your Premium\",\"7 days for FREE\":\"7 days for FREE\",\"/Month\":{\" Input\":\"/Month. Input your payment information to activate your 7-day trial.\"},\"Activate Your Trial\":\"Activate Your Trial\",\"Activate Feature\":\"Activate Feature\",\"and then\":\"and then\",\"billing_2\":\"If you don't know how to access your Hotmart billing account, kindly check your email OR \u003ca href=\\\"{url}\\\"\u003erequest to reset your password\u003c/a\u003e using the same email as APWin\",\"Manage your Premium Subscription\":\"Manage your Premium Subscription\",\"Manage Billing\":\"Manage Billing\",\"billing_1\":\"Your subscription is managed by Hotmart (our partner payment provider), if you would like to update your credit card please visit Hotmart by clicking the button below\",\"try_premium_for_free\":\"Try Premium for Free\",\"Your account has not yet been upgraded to Premium\":\"Your account has not yet been upgraded to Premium, payment is missing\",\"Are you sure want to cancel?\":\"Are you sure want to cancel?\",\"Activate Your 7-day Trial\":\"Activate Your 7-day Trial\",\"Click below to complete\":\"Click below to complete or cancel your subscription.\",\"Complete Payment\":\"Complete Payment\",\"Paid Subscription\":\"Paid Subscription\",\"Cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"You can try premium access\":\"You can try premium access paying a monthly subscription.\",\"Billing\":\"Billing\",\"Get one time 7-days FREE Premium access\":\"Get one time 7-days FREE Premium access\",\"Missing payment\":\"Missing payment\",\"Unlock With a Partner\":\"Unlock With a Partner\",\"Activate Premium\":\"Activate Premium\",\"My Premium\":\"My Premium\",\"Hotmart platform\":\"Subscribe on Hotmart\",\"bankroll_main_1\":\"This is the best Bankroll Management Software in the market. 100% Automated, and Guaranteed to give you better results\",\"bankroll_main_3\":\"Request access now, and within 24h you will have access to the most complete solution in the market.\",\"bankroll_main_4\":\"You can also read about \u003ca href=\\\"{url}\\\"\u003ehow it works here\u003c/a\u003e\",\"bankroll_main_2\":\"You can know your performance in great detail, and know your results, for example, per country, per team, per bet type, day of the week and much more.\",\"bankroll_in_progress\":\"Your Bankroll request is still in progress, we will notify you when it is ready.\",\"trial_expired\":\"Your trial expired, validate your account!\",\"Glossary\":\"Glossary\",\"Bankroll\":\"Bankroll\",\"Academy\":\"Academy\",\"Support\":\"Support\",\"premium\":\"Premium\",\"verify_account\":\"Verify Account\",\"upgrade_to_premium\":\"Upgrade to Premium (2 days FREE).\",\"Trial Expired\":\"Trial Expired\",\"upgrade_desc\":\"By upgrading to premium, you will have access to exclusive data, content, and other tools.\u003cbr\u003eJoin premium \u003cstrong\u003e100% FREE\u003c/strong\u003e and learn how to bet like a PRO.\",\"Create Account\":\"Create Account\",\"Unlock one of our Partners\":\"Unlock One of Our Partners\",\"Error\":\"Error!\",\"p_5\":\"Signup for BetWinner, get free access to APWin, and enjoy all the benefits of one of our partner bookmakers!\",\"premium_exipired\":\"Your Premium Access has Expired!\",\"p_1\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eCreate an account with BetWinner, and unlock access to APWin.\u003c/strong\u003e\",\"premium_activated\":\"Thank you for activating your premium account. To keep your premium access, you should bet frequently.\",\"p_4\":\"Some of the main benefits of BetWinner are:\",\"Expired\":\"Expired!\",\"premium_expired_text\":\"Make a bet, or deposit in one of our partners. Your premium access will renew automatically. \u003ca href=\\\"{url}\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClick here to bet.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"ask_to_create_account\":\"Create an account at \u003ca href=\\\"{url}\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e{partner} by clicking here\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e, and use the promo code \u003cstrong\u003eAPWin\u003c/strong\u003e.\",\"p_2\":\"BetWinner is one of the fastest-growing bookmakers in the world and has gained a lot of users, especially in Latin America, Africa, and Asia.\",\"Verifying\":\"Verifying\",\"Create an account at Betwinner, and use the promo code APWin\":{\"\":\"Create an account at BetWinner, and use the promo code APWin.\"},\"youre_almost_there\":\"You're almost there!\",\"player_id_already_used\":\"Your player ID is already in use. Accounts cannot be shared, please create a new account at {partner_name}\",\"welcome_back\":\"Welcome back! See below upcoming matches.\",\"l_2\":\"Very high odds.\",\"l_3\":\"Easy to use\",\"Waiting player id\":\"Waiting player id\",\"trial_end_in\":\"Your trial ends in {num} days\",\"Your country is not supported\":\"Your country is not supported.\",\"l_1\":\"A signup, and weekly 100% bonus on deposits.\",\"Unlock Premium\":\"Unlock Premium\",\"l_4\":\"Over 100 markets to bet on per event.\",\"Become Premium\":\"Become Premium\",\"success\":\"Success! You're Premium.\",\"ask_to_put_the_id\":\"Copy your Player ID from {partner} and verify your account below.\",\"Active\":\"Active\",\"your_partner_player_id\":\"Your {partner} Player ID\",\"by_creating_an_account\":\"By creating an account in one of our partners you'll get 2-day FREE Trial.\",\"l_5\":\"More than 1.000 events per day.\",\"Verification Failed\":\"Verification Failed\",\"fail_to_add\":\"We couldn't find your player account at {partner_name}. Please wait up to 10 minutes and try again.\",\"get_one_time\":\"Get one time 2-days FREE Premium access.\",\"p_3\":\"Users of BetWinner can benefit from a 100% signup bonus. There is also a weekly 100% bonus for deposits made on Thursday so that you can increase your bank even more.\",\"update_password_success\":\"Your password has been changed!\",\"change_password\":{\"password_missmatch\":\"Current password did not match!\",\"success\":\"Password successfully changed!\",\"member_not_found\":\"Member not found!\"},\"profile_update\":{\"success\":\"Profile has been updated\"}},\"streams_faq\":{\"title1\":\"Faq title 1\",\"paragraph4\":\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Proin consequat a ante id imperdiet. Curabitur pellentesque risus non magna consectetur t