 All Competitions\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAPWin\u0026#039;s match stats pages go well beyond the scoreline and give you the numbers that actually drive intelligent betting decisions:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGoals scored and conceded by half, across the current season\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eExpected Goals (xG) for both attack and defence\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCorners, cards, and fouls — total counts and per-match averages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHead-to-head records going back multiple seasons\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWinning and losing streaks, clean sheet runs, and scoring trends\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eForm tables filtered by home, away, and combined performance\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 id='where-to-watch-today\u0026#039;s-football-live'\u003eWhere to Watch Today\u0026#039;s Football Live\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFinding out which platform is showing a specific match used to mean checking three or four different websites. On APWin, every match page includes the broadcast details — TV channel, streaming service, or sports betting site — for that fixture, updated daily.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e📺 Check out today’s matches with\u003ca href='https://www.apwin.com/streams/'\u003e live streaming\u003c/a\u003e from all around the world.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 id='predictions-for-today’s-football-matches'\u003ePredictions for today’s football matches\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eOur team produces predictions based on statistics, club news, recent team form, goal averages, and much more. In other words, you get insights from those who really know the game before placing your bet.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e⚽ Check out\u003ca href='https://www.apwin.com/predictions/'\u003e today’s football predictions\u003c/a\u003e now.\u003c/p\u003e63:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"cla